name xgreek
category Package
revision 64300
shortdesc Greek Language Support for XeLaTeX and LuaLaTeX
longdesc This package has been designed so to allow people to typeset
longdesc Greek language documents using XeLaTeX or LuaLaTeX. It is
longdesc released in the hope that people will use it and spot errors,
longdesc bugs, features so to improve it. Practically, it provides all
longdesc the capabilities of the greek option of the babel package. The
longdesc package can be invoked with any of the following options:
longdesc monotonic (for typesetting modern monotonic Greek), polytonic
longdesc (for typesetting modern polytonic Greek), and ancient (for
longdesc typesetting ancient texts). The default option is monotonic.
longdesc The command \setlanguage{<lang>} activates the hyphenation
longdesc patterns of the language <lang>. This, however, can only be
longdesc done if the format file has not been built with the babel
longdesc mechanism.
